# Line endings are part of what this repository hashes and compares — the
# pinned annotation specs (experiments/annotation_tools.py), the frozen
# experiment code and prompts, the deploy scripts that `bash -n` checks — so a
# checkout must not depend on the cloner's `core.autocrlf` (Git for Windows
# defaults it to true). Text files are LF in the index and in every working
# tree, on every OS.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows batch scripts are CRLF by design: stored and checked out unchanged.
*.bat -text
